  "chitchat": [
    "rehearses a point of order to no one in particular.",
    "\"Someone must mind the west gate. It may as well be me. It certainly won't be them.\""
  ],
  "description": "A back-bench Assemblyman with a florid manner and a genuine, unfashionable belief that the government should govern something. It has made him a nuisance to everyone, including himself.",
  "dialogue_tree": {
    "accepted": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "START_QUEST",
          "quest_id": "quest_prefects_problem"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Understood.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Splendid! West of Onyx Row — the Scald, the steppe, the sootbanks. Four should quiet them. Do watch the leach-beds; they are not on any map I'd trust.\""
    },
    "bye": {
      "options": [],
      "text": "\"Quite. Well. Someone must, I suppose.\""
    },
    "quest_offer": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I'll cull them.",
          "next": "accepted"
        },
        {
          "label": "It's done. (report back)",
          "next": "reported"
        },
        {
          "label": "Not my business.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Jackals — wire-jackals, the wretched wire-and-scab kind — are coming up out of the wastes and into the Registry's overflow archives. Nobody official will act; jurisdiction, you understand. Cull four of them for me and I'll see you're paid and papered.\""
    },
    "reported": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "TURN_IN",
          "quest_id": "quest_prefects_problem"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Obliged.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"...The archivists report quiet in the overflow stacks. Extraordinary. Here — your fee, and a permit stamped by my own hand, which still means something in three or four offices.\""
    },
    "root": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What is it?",
          "next": "quest_offer"
        },
        {
          "label": "Afraid not.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Assemblyman Croll brightens at the sight of anyone who might listen. \"You there — you have the look of someone who solves things. This chamber does the opposite. Might I trouble you?\""
    }
  },
